 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi! How are you today?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.55,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_02"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Kind of tired, honestly.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.44,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm seventy and studying for an amateur radio licence. My brain isn't what it used to be.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.38,
   "block": "studying.dlg31",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's a great thing to take on. What's the hardest part so far?",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.37,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "studying.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "The electronics. Ohms and volts and all that.",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 0.87,
   "block": "studying.dlg31",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's where most people struggle. Try thinking of it like water in pipes. Voltage is the pressure, current is how much flows.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.71,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "studying.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Oh, that does make it easier.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 2.14,
   "block": "studying.dlg31",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "And resistance is how narrow the pipe is. Once that picture clicks, the formulas make more sense.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 1.29,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "studying.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I write everything down",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 2.75,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "studying.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "three times and still forget it.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 2.52,
   "block": "studying.dlg31",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Try explaining it out loud to someone, or even to the dog. Teaching it helps more than copying it.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 1.02,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "studying.dlg31"
  }
 ]
